    "name": "Crit Happens!",
    "steam_appid": 3711540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crit Happens!</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you get to <strong>customize</strong> your dice for each encounter! In <strong><i>Crit Happens!</i></strong> you'll <strong>roll</strong> your dice before attacking, choosing which dice to <strong>hold</strong> and which dice to <strong>re-roll</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/93b3f3bf93397b0e05cdbb17d4302761.poster.avif?t=1754753345\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/93b3f3bf93397b0e05cdbb17d4302761.webm?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/93b3f3bf93397b0e05cdbb17d4302761.mp4?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.poster.avif?t=1754753345\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.webm?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.mp4?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. Do you <strong>hold</strong> or do you <strong>roll</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/44f5eb48df90f7a0475ae8b691b5b7ca.poster.avif?t=1754753345\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/44f5eb48df90f7a0475ae8b691b5b7ca.webm?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/44f5eb48df90f7a0475ae8b691b5b7ca.mp4?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice as you play, enhancing your strength as you continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of dice faces you'll find on your adventure, each with its own unique effect that can be applied to your attacks. You'll get to fully customize each of your dice each time you find a new face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the way you play by discovering new trinkets and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets can be found throughout your journey; each affecting the way your attack is calculated. Each turn will cycle through your collection of trinkets, forcing you to tackle each turn from a different perspective. Relics offer permanent effects, empowering certain dice faces, or simply increasing your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the dangerous, ever-shifting lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ever-changing, with no two runs being the same. Travel through harsh deserts and blistering snowstorms, as you choose your path via your trusty map. Will you prioritize safe havens, or brave the elite enemies in hope of rewards?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crit Happens!</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you get to <strong>customize</strong> your dice for each encounter! In <strong><i>Crit Happens!</i></strong> you'll <strong>roll</strong> your dice before attacking, choosing which dice to <strong>hold</strong> and which dice to <strong>re-roll</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/93b3f3bf93397b0e05cdbb17d4302761.poster.avif?t=1754753345\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/93b3f3bf93397b0e05cdbb17d4302761.webm?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/93b3f3bf93397b0e05cdbb17d4302761.mp4?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.poster.avif?t=1754753345\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.webm?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.mp4?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. Do you <strong>hold</strong> or do you <strong>roll</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/44f5eb48df90f7a0475ae8b691b5b7ca.poster.avif?t=1754753345\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/44f5eb48df90f7a0475ae8b691b5b7ca.webm?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/44f5eb48df90f7a0475ae8b691b5b7ca.mp4?t=1754753345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice as you play, enhancing your strength as you continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of dice faces you'll find on your adventure, each with its own unique effect that can be applied to your attacks. You'll get to fully customize each of your dice each time you find a new face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the way you play by discovering new trinkets and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets can be found throughout your journey; each affecting the way your attack is calculated. Each turn will cycle through your collection of trinkets, forcing you to tackle each turn from a different perspective. Relics offer permanent effects, empowering certain dice faces, or simply increasing your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the dangerous, ever-shifting lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ever-changing, with no two runs being the same. Travel through harsh deserts and blistering snowstorms, as you choose your path via your trusty map. Will you prioritize safe havens, or brave the elite enemies in hope of rewards?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A turn-based roguelike where every attack is decided by a roll of the dice \u2013\u00a0Know when to roll and when to hold to increase your attack and defeat powerful enemies. Craft your dice and seek out magical trinkets and powerful relics that will change the way you play!",
